&lt;p&gt;You will sit at the center of Tapestry’s mission to “make the grid visible” by building the core systems and workflows that empower users to manage grid model data. We are seeking an experienced, detail-oriented, and technically-inclined Product Manager to lead our Model Management initiatives. In this role, you will collaborate across technical and commercial teams and alongside subject-matter experts to define, build, and deliver essential grid network model management capabilities to both internal and external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
