&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools to refine and optimize collaborative workflows across the entire product development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering, design, commercial, and other teams to define and execute a core Tapestry product line.&lt;/li&gt;
