&lt;li&gt;Industry experience with infrastructure as Code tooling (&lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;) across multiple environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with networking fundamentals (VPCs, BGP, Service Mesh, DNS, CDN) and modern cloud security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing high-throughput, low-latency infrastructure architectures handling millions of daily requests or petabytes of data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in distributed systems concepts, load balancing strategies, disaster recovery design, and fault isolation patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Typescript &lt;/strong&gt;(bonus: &lt;strong&gt;Rust&lt;/strong&gt;) to build APIs, automation tools, CLI, internal products, and system utilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud-native telemetry toolsets, such as &lt;strong&gt;OpenTelemetry&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Prometheus&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Grafana&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Datadog&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate ambiguity and rapidly pivot in a startup-like, high-risk research environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It’d be great if you also had these:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
