&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Materra is looking for a Software Engineer with practical experience developing C++ systems that communicate with hardware sensors.&lt;/p&gt;
