&lt;li&gt;Rapidly develop system prototypes to evaluate feasibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong end-to-end ownership of the software infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable data pipelines for training AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively with cross-functional teams of engineers, scientists, and domain experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with collaborators across X and Alphabet (e.g. Google, DeepMind, Cloud, , etc.) to apply, modify, and develop new ideas, techniques, algorithms, and tools as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MS/PhD in Computer Science or demonstrable practical experience in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years experience writing software that interacts with a variety of asynchronous hardware sensors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building data management platforms in C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of deep learning model building, validation, and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and managing scalable data pipelines and backend integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with C++, Python, and Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It’d be great if you also had these:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Cloud Platform tools like Dataflow and VertexAI&lt;/li&gt;
